<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="1dd36258">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Synchronize transition strategy to the plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Coordinate resources of transition design plan by using the service management resourcing plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Finalize controls for disruption across transition activities by using the finalized interim service management
        model
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Finalize a framework of standard re-usable processes and supporting systems resulting from additional cutover
        activities by using the end-state service management model
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Finalize work-arounds for critical business processes in case of failures using the interim service management
        model
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Finalize temporary interfaces required during transition using the interim service management model
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
