<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="c87a25e9"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="6b087ec">&lt;p&gt;
    Set up a meeting to seek agreement that the plan:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Aligns with the service management strategy for resource planning and coordination
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Controls the risks of failure and disruption across transition activities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Includes a common framework of standard re-usable processes and supporting systems
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Includes work-arounds for critical business processes in case of failures
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Includes temporary interfaces required during transition
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Obtain signatures from team leads.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Communicate agreement to project team and key stakeholders.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
