<attribute name="name" nodeId="4fe0af34">Periodically review and update the transitional design plan</attribute>
<attribute name="guid" nodeId="cb2dfcee">_XGoH4EIUEeW5Je4_Pavktg</attribute>
<attribute name="presentationName" nodeId="eb6fff42">Periodically review and update the transitional design plan</attribute>
<attribute name="briefDescription" nodeId="3242b62"></attribute>
<attribute name="suppressed" nodeId="71743c58">false</attribute>
<attribute name="orderingGuide" nodeId="31cacf53"></attribute>
<attribute name="variabilityType" nodeId="958b30ac">na</attribute>
<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="6bfb7940"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="149ba4b1">&lt;p&gt;
    To enable more current and complete assessments of scope change impacts, timing, and dependencies impacting the
    cutover, review the&amp;nbsp;baseline cutover and deployment&amp;nbsp;transition design plan at agreed intervals.&amp;nbsp;
    Determine potential impacts and potential risks to the cutover window,&amp;nbsp;make changes as necessary, and communicate
    the most up-to-date information to inform re-planning to key stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review the baseline version of the cutover and deployment plan with impacted project teams and business
        stakeholders during the middle-to-later-part of the build activity
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Determine changes to key business and technical activities along with their readiness criteria and approach (e.g.,
        new or modified old tasks, dependencies and durations and impacts due to new change requests)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Seek PMO input on the overall progress of the implementation plan to identify dependencies and potential impacts to
        the cutover plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Seek inputs from program leadership for additional considerations (e.g., overall change in direction, release plan,
        deployment options) in order to identify potential impacts to the cutover plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Incorporate all applicable changes into the revised version of the cutover and deployment plan 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Update the plan for resource planning and coordination
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Update controls to address potential disruptions across transition activities
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Update the framework of standard re-usable processes and supporting systems
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Make adjustments to provide work-arounds for critical business processes in case of failures
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Add or make changes to temporary interfaces required during transition as a result of detailed cutover
                activities information.
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review significant impacts to the cutover window and timing with program leadership, especially if go-live date
        changes are possible
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Distribute the updated plan to all workstream leads, PMO, program and business leadership&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
